                            en: { titulus: "Translations & Commentary", contentus: `<p><b>Literal Translation:</b><br><i>The Gauls from the Aquitani the river Garonne, from the Belgae the Marne and the Seine divides.</i></p><p><b>Idiomatic Translation:</b><br><i>The Garonne river separates the Gauls from the Aquitani; the Marne and the Seine separate them from the Belgae.</i></p>` },
                            zh: { titulus: "翻譯與註釋", contentus: `<p><b>直譯：</b><br><i>加龍河將高盧人與阿基坦人分開，馬恩河與塞納河將他們與貝爾格人分開。</i></p><p><b>意譯：</b><br><i>加龍河分隔了高盧人與阿基坦尼人；馬恩河和塞納河則將他們與貝爾格人分開。</i></p>` }
